{"slug":"sh-e-r","ar":"ش ع ر","total":40,"core":"perceiving; poetry; hair; rites","forms":[{"ar":"يَشْعُرُ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":25,"gloss":"to perceive, realize","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":202,"p":5,"ar":["فَيَأْتِيَهُم","بَغْتَةً","وَهُمْ","لَا","يَشْعُرُونَ"],"en":"And it will come to them suddenly while they perceive [it] not"}},{"ar":"شَاعِر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"Poet","word":"shair","ex":{"s":26,"a":224,"p":1,"ar":["وَٱلشُّعَرَآءُ","يَتَّبِعُهُمُ","ٱلْغَاوُۥنَ"],"en":"And the poets - [only] the deviators follow them"}},{"ar":"شَعَٰٓئِر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"rites, symbols","word":null,"ex":{"s":22,"a":32,"p":4,"ar":["ذَٰلِكَ","وَمَن","يُعَظِّمْ","شَعَـٰٓئِرَ","ٱللَّهِ","فَإِنَّهَا","مِن","تَقْوَى","ٱلْقُلُوبِ"],"en":"That [is so]. And whoever honors the symbols of Allah - indeed, it is from the piety of hearts"}},{"ar":"شِّعْر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"poetry; hair","word":null,"ex":{"s":36,"a":69,"p":3,"ar":["وَمَا","عَلَّمْنَـٰهُ","ٱلشِّعْرَ","وَمَا","يَنۢبَغِى","لَهُۥٓ ۚ","إِنْ","هُوَ","إِلَّا","ذِكْرٌ","وَقُرْءَانٌ","مُّبِينٌ"],"en":"And We did not give Prophet Muhammad, knowledge of poetry, nor is it befitting for him. It is not but a message and a clear Qur'an"}},{"ar":"يُشْعِرُ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":2,"gloss":"to make perceive","word":null,"ex":{"s":6,"a":109,"p":16,"ar":["وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","جَهْدَ","أَيْمَـٰنِهِمْ","لَئِن","جَآءَتْهُمْ","ءَايَةٌ","لَّيُؤْمِنُنَّ","بِهَا ۚ","قُلْ","إِنَّمَا","ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتُ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ ۖ","وَمَا","يُشْعِرُكُمْ","أَنَّهَآ","إِذَا","جَآءَتْ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"en":"And they swear by Allah their strongest oaths that if a sign came to them, they would surely believe in it. Say, \"The signs are only with Allah.\" And what will make you perceive that even if a sign came, they would not believe"}},{"ar":"شِّعْرَىٰ","kind":"name","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"Sirius","word":null,"ex":{"s":53,"a":49,"p":4,"ar":["وَأَنَّهُۥ","هُوَ","رَبُّ","ٱلشِّعْرَىٰ"],"en":"And that it is He who is the Lord of Sirius"}},{"ar":"مَشْعَر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"the Sacred Monument","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":198,"p":16,"ar":["لَيْسَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","جُنَاحٌ","أَن","تَبْتَغُوا۟","فَضْلًا","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ ۚ","فَإِذَآ","أَفَضْتُم","مِّنْ","عَرَفَـٰتٍ","فَٱذْكُرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","عِندَ","ٱلْمَشْعَرِ","ٱلْحَرَامِ ۖ","وَٱذْكُرُوهُ","كَمَا","هَدَىٰكُمْ","وَإِن","كُنتُم","مِّن","قَبْلِهِۦ","لَمِنَ","ٱلضَّآلِّينَ"],"en":"There is no blame upon you for seeking bounty from your Lord [during Hajj]. But when you depart from 'Arafat, remember Allah at al- Mash'ar al-Haram. And remember Him, as He has guided you, for indeed, you were before that among those astray"}}],"surahs":[[2,5],[16,4],[6,3],[26,3],[27,3],[12,2],[22,2],[28,2],[39,2],[3,1],[5,1],[7,1],[18,1],[21,1],[23,1],[29,1],[36,1],[37,1],[43,1],[49,1],[52,1],[53,1],[69,1]]}